 "text": "Twist-beam kinematics and compliance test suspension, 11 inputs, 6 outputs, {Drivetrain type} sets Type of drivetrain; {Steered axle enable by axle, StrgEnByAxl} sets the boolean vector to enable axle steering, {Anti-sway axle enable by axle, AntiSwayEnByAxl} sets the boolean vector to enable axle anti-sway, {Suspension type} sets the type of suspension Independent front, {+ Steer angle} sets the positive steer angle, {+ Fx used in compliance tests} sets the positive longitudinal force, {+ Fy used in compliance tests} sets the positive lateral force, {+ Suspension Jounce} sets the positive suspension jounce, {+ WhlMz used in compliance tests} sets the positive yaw moment, {Shock type} sets the type of shock, {Shock force vs shock compression rate, ShckFrcVsCompRate} sets the table struct, {Motion ratios by axle, MotRatios} sets the table struct, {Bump steer, BumpSteer} sets the table struct, {Bump camber, BumpCamber} sets the table struct, {Bump caster, BumpCaster} sets the table struct, {Lateral wheel center displacement, LatWhlCtrDisp} sets the table struct, {Longitudinal wheel center displacement, LngWhlCtrDisp} sets the table struct, {Normal wheel rates, NrmlWhlRates} sets the table struct, {Normal wheel force offsets, NrmlWhlFrcOff} sets the force offset, {Roll steer, RollSteer} sets the table struct, {Roll camber, RollCamber} sets the table struct, {Roll caster, RollCaster} sets the table struct, {Front suspension roll stiffness with anti-roll bar, RollStiffArbFrnt} sets the anti-sway bar enabled, {Front suspension roll stiffness without anti-roll bar, RollStiffNoArbFrnt} sets the anti-sway bar not enabled, {Rear suspension roll stiffness without twist-beam, RollStiffNoTwstRear} sets the anti-sway bar not enabled, {Camber vs steer angle, CambVsSteerAng} sets the table struct, {Caster vs steer angle, CastVsSteerAng} sets the table struct, {Longitudinal steer compliance, LngSteerCompl} sets the table struct, {Longitudinal camber compliance, LngCambCompl} sets the table struct, {Longitudinal caster compliance, LngCastCompl} sets the table struct, {Longitudinal wheel center compliance, LngWhlCtrCompl} sets the table struct, {Lateral wheel center compliance, LatWhlCtrComplLng} sets the table struct, {Lateral steer compliance, LatSteerCompl} sets the table struct, {Lateral camber compliance, LatCambCompl} sets the table struct, {Lateral wheel center compliance from lateral sources, LatWhlCtrComplLat} sets the table struct, {Aligning torque steer compliance, AlgnTrqSteerCompl} sets the table struct, {Aligning torque camber compliance, AlgnTrqCambCompl} sets the table struct, {Vertical load transfer, VrtLdTrnsfr} sets the table struct, {Toe, StatToe} sets the wheel toe angle, {Camber, StatCamber} sets the wheel camber angle, {Caster, StatCaster} sets the wheel caster angle and {Static loaded radius of wheels, StatLdWhlR} sets the wheel radius. Values come from the instance.",
